    <item>
      <title>TimeTug 1.3.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 18:35:58 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>20260923183122</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
&lt;meta charset="utf-8"&gt;
&lt;style&gt;
body {
  font: 13px -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
  color: #1d1d1f;
  margin: 12px 16px;
  word-wrap: break-word;
}
a { color: #0068da; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-size: 1.05em; }
pre, code { font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.95em; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body { color: #f5f5f7; }
  a { color: #4da3ff; }
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
&lt;h2 dir="auto"&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Created portable library + read-only Google connector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added Accounts tab and ability to connect to Google Calendar natively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added the Google sign-in workflow (still unverified)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tug Rules, Accounts and Calendars panes: Enable Tug, calendar kinds, sections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous UI changes in settings with polish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BUG: Don't treat Google's own event-view link as a conference join link&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BUG: Fixed shortcut hot key assignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/darkarena1/timetug/compare/v1.2.2...v1.3.0"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v1.2.2...v1.3.0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
</description>
